        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The monthly and yearly plans renew automatically at the end of each period until you cancel them. Cancel any time in Settings › Apple Account › Subscriptions, at least a day before the renewal date. The one-off unlock is a single payment and never renews."
